# Payment endpoint tests are split into:
#
# http/payment/00-payment-auth.http
# http/payment/01-payment-get-claim.http
# http/payment/02-payment-retry.http
# http/payment/03-payment-fail.http
# http/payment/04-order-payment-start.http
#
# Start the backend with `npm run dev`.
# Run both login requests in 00-payment-auth.http first.
# The VS Code REST Client cookie jar keeps the two sessions under
# localhost and 127.0.0.1 as separate hosts.
#
# These tests require an existing Payment. Until
# POST /admin/orders/:orderId/payment is implemented, create the Payment
# through seed data or Prisma Studio.
